'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include readable.iuml

title Checking each planned day
participant ":MishMash" as App
participant ":CheckShortfallCommand" as Check
participant ":ActiveMealPlan" as Active
participant ":MealPlan" as Plan
participant "day:DayPlan" as Day
App -> Check : execute(book)
activate Check
Check -> Active : get()
activate Active
Active --> Check : optional plan
deactivate Active
note over Active, Plan : Continue only when the plan has days.
loop each day in order
  Check -> Plan : getDays()
  activate Plan
  Plan --> Check : days
  deactivate Plan
  Check -> Check : findShortfalls(day)
  activate Check
  Check -> Day : getTotalCalories()
  activate Day
  Day --> Check : total: long
  deactivate Day
  note over Active, Day
    Read targets.getCalories(); call addShortfall(...).
    When total < supplied target, append target - total.
    Repeat for protein, carbs, and fats.
  end note
  Check --> Check : deficit lines
  deactivate Check
end
Check --> App : per-day report
deactivate Check

@enduml
'@@author
